            "review_title": "Review at Sky Garden Seafood & Coffee",
            "review_text": "Garry H\n27 contributions\n0\nBest avoided\nDec 2024 • Couples\nWe had to pay before entering. BIG mistake. If you do decide to eat here would recommend you insist on viewing the buffet before paying - you WILL be disappointed.\nSeafood NOT fresh. Chicken dried out. Noodles okay, fruit okay.\nLocation and roof top view was great, We visited on Xmas Eve with just one other couple in the restaurant. So much dried out food going to waste - or perhaps will be reserved tomorrow \nBest avoid.\nRead more\nWritten December 25, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
